module

public import Theory.SpecificGroups.C4SquareSignSwapCentricGenerators

/-!
# Checked data for subgroup enumeration of the sign-and-swap group

The tables give 84 subgroup carriers, normal forms, 915 one-element
extensions up to conjugacy, and right-coset factorizations reducing every
extension to one of these edges. All tables are witness data; their equations
are checked by kernel reduction below. Completeness is proved in the parent
module using the elementary extension argument of `SubgroupEnumeration`.

Source: direct enumeration in the coordinates of `C4SquareSignSwap`;
`Generate.py` reproduces the witnesses without supplying any proof oracle.
-/

namespace C4SquareSignSwap.EnumerationCertificate
open Theory.GroupTheory Theory.GroupTheory.SubgroupEnumeration
set_option maxRecDepth 100000

